    {
      "id": "file:common/timer_wheel/timer_scheduler.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "timer_scheduler.h",
      "filePath": "common/timer_wheel/timer_scheduler.h",
      "summary": "高级定时器调度器，封装 TimerWheel 和 ThreadPool，提供 Schedule（单次）、ScheduleRecurring（周期性）、Cancel、Pause/Resume/Stop、Post 等接口。支持 direct_execute 模式（pub 场景直接在 timer 线程执行）和线程池投递模式（sub 场景避免阻塞），含 CallbackTimer 和 RecurringCallbackTimer 两个内部实现类。",
      "tags": ["timer", "scheduler", "header-only", "concurrency", "core-infrastructure"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:common/timer_wheel/timer_wheel.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "timer_wheel.h",
      "filePath": "common/timer_wheel/timer_wheel.h",
      "summary": "8 层分级时间轮算法实现（源自 Ratas 库），每层 256 槽位，支持 1 tick 到多天范围的定时器调度。提供 schedule、schedule_in_range、advance 等核心操作，事件通过双向链表挂载在对应槽位，高层轮事件在底层轮旋转时逐级下放执行。",
      "tags": ["timer-wheel", "algorithm", "header-only", "hierarchical-wheel", "core-infrastructure"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "8 层分级时间轮，每层 8 bit（256 槽），覆盖 64 bit 时间范围。事件使用侵入式双向链表挂在 TimerWheelSlot 上，cancel 通过 relink(NULL) 实现 O(1) 移除。"
    },
    {
